# Line-ending policy: one canonical form across every checkout.
#
# This repo is edited from both Windows and WSL (see docs/adr/). Without a
# pinned policy, `core.autocrlf` decides per-machine and the two environments
# write different bytes for the same file.
#
# Blobs are stored LF; every working tree is checked out LF, so the bytes on
# disk are identical regardless of platform or local git config.
#
# Binary assets (og-card.png, fonts/*) are detected by git's auto heuristic and
# left untouched, as are the self-hosted font subsets.
* text=auto eol=lf
